					"nextDialogs": [
						230390404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230390404,
					"content": "#嘿嘿，我说了很擅长跑步的，{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}难道是轻敌了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "希尔米"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390405,
					"content": "不过，就算是跑这么快，哈巴奇哥哥还是会抓住我们，到底是为什么呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390406,
						230390407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奥贝德"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390406,
					"content": "也许是抄了近路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390408
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230390408,
					"content": "是这样吗？唔…但是这周围好像也没什么近路啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奥贝德"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390409,
					"content": "#不然，我们下次请{M#大哥哥}{F#大姐姐}来陪我们玩…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "希尔米"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390410,
					"content": "陪我们训练！那个…训练那个「野外匿踪」吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "希尔米"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390411,
					"content": "对喔，既然跑不过哈巴奇哥哥，那我们就绕开他…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奥贝德"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390412,
					"content": "我们之前不都绕过了吗？但是无论如何都会被哈巴奇哥哥发现的啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "希尔米"
				},
				{
					"id": 230390407,
					"content": "也许是有什么诀窍…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230390408
					]
